<template>
 <view class="travel-studio">
  <view class="studio-heading"><view><text class="eyebrow">YOUR PLACES, YOUR STORIES</text><view class="studio-title">旅行足迹</view></view><text class="local-badge">仅保存在本机</text></view>
  <view class="travel-stats"><view><text>{{ stats.regions }}</text><text>省级地区</text></view><view><text>{{ stats.cities }}</text><text>地点 / 城市</text></view><view><text>{{ stats.trips }}</text><text>次旅行</text></view></view>
  <view class="map-tools"><view class="toggle-label"><switch :disabled="busy" :checked="j.mapEnabled" color="#526c58" @change="setSwitch('mapEnabled',$event)"/><text>足迹地图合成到海报</text></view><button :disabled="busy" class="quiet" @click="resetView">复位地图</button></view>
  <view ref="host" id="travel-map" class="travel-map" role="img" aria-label="可缩放的中国旅行足迹地图；可用下方地区列表替代地图点击"></view>
  <view v-if="mapError" class="travel-warning">{{ mapError }}<button :disabled="busy" class="quiet" @click="mountMap">重试地图</button></view>
  <text class="travel-help">可拖动、缩放；点击地区切换手动标记，点击足迹查看记录。南海相关几何按原始坐标完整展示，不制作虚构底图。海报始终导出全国范围，照片卡片仍为装饰拼贴。</text>
  <view v-if="mapStops.length" class="map-stop-list"><button :disabled="busy" v-for="s in mapStops" :key="s.id" class="quiet" @click="selectedStopId=s.id">查看 {{ s.place.name }}</button></view>
  <view v-if="selectedStop" class="selected-stop"><text>{{ selectedStop.place.name }} · {{ selectedStop.date || '未填写日期' }}</text><text>{{ selectedStop.note || '还没有札记' }}</text><image v-if="selectedThumb" :src="selectedThumb" mode="aspectFill" class="stop-photo"/><text v-else-if="selectedStop.photoSlot">关联照片未找到</text><button :disabled="busy" class="quiet" @click="selectedStopId=''">收起</button></view>
  <view class="travel-line"><label for="trip-filter">地图范围</label><select :disabled="busy" id="trip-filter" v-model="j.activeTrip"><option value="all">全部旅行</option><option v-for="t in j.trips" :key="t.id" :value="t.id">{{ t.name }}</option></select></view>
  <view class="map-tools"><view class="toggle-label"><switch :disabled="busy" :checked="j.showRoutes" color="#526c58" @change="setSwitch('showRoutes',$event)"/><text>显示地点顺序连线</text></view><button :disabled="busy" class="quiet" @click="regionsOpen=!regionsOpen">{{ regionsOpen?'收起地区':'标记去过的地区' }}</button></view>
  <text class="travel-help">连线只表示记录顺序，不是导航路线。统计基于全部真实记录及手动地区标记，不包含示例照片。</text>
  <view v-if="regionsOpen" class="region-grid"><button :disabled="busy" v-for="r in regions" :key="r.id" :class="{'visited':regionVisited(r.id)}" :aria-pressed="regionVisited(r.id)" @click="toggleRegion(r.id)">{{ regionVisited(r.id)?'✓ ':'' }}{{ r.name }}</button></view>
  <view class="travel-divider"></view>
  <view class="travel-subtitle">记录一次出发</view>
  <view class="travel-line"><label class="new-trip-label">旅行名称<input :disabled="busy" class="trip-name-input" v-model="newTripName" maxlength="60" aria-label="新旅行名称" placeholder="例如：春天的杭州之旅"/></label><button :disabled="busy" class="solid" @click="addTrip">新建旅行</button></view>
  <view v-if="!j.trips.length" class="travel-empty">还没有旅行记录。先新建旅行，再添加地点、日期和照片关联。</view>
  <view class="trip-list"><button :disabled="busy" v-for="t in j.trips" :key="t.id" :class="['trip-chip',{'current':j.activeTrip===t.id}]" @click="j.activeTrip=t.id">{{ t.name }} · {{ t.stops.length }} 站</button></view>
  <view v-if="active" class="trip-editor"><button class="solid apply-trip" :disabled="busy" @click="$emit('apply-trip',active.id)">将本次旅行载入手账</button><text class="travel-help">取本次旅行前四张已关联照片及名称、札记、日期；不删除原旅行记录。</text>
   <label class="travel-field">旅行名称<input :disabled="busy" v-model="active.name" maxlength="60" aria-label="旅行名称"/></label>
   <label class="travel-field">旅行札记<textarea :disabled="busy" v-model="active.note" maxlength="500" aria-label="旅行札记" placeholder="写下这次出发的故事"/></label>
   <view class="timeline"><view v-for="(s,index) in active.stops" :key="s.id" class="timeline-stop"><view class="stop-dot">{{ index+1 }}</view><view class="stop-content"><view class="stop-title">{{ s.place.name }}<text>{{ s.date||'未填写日期' }}</text></view><text class="travel-help">{{ s.place.regionName }}{{ s.photoSlot?' · 已存照片':'' }}</text><text v-if="s.note" class="stop-note">{{ s.note }}</text><view class="stop-actions"><button :disabled="busy" class="quiet" @click="editStop(s)">编辑</button><button class="quiet" :disabled="busy || (index===0)" @click="moveStop(active!,index,-1)">上移</button><button class="quiet" :disabled="busy || (index===active.stops.length-1)" @click="moveStop(active!,index,1)">下移</button><button :disabled="busy" class="quiet danger" @click="removeStop(s.id)">删除</button></view></view></view></view>
   <view class="travel-subtitle small">{{ editingId?'编辑地点':'添加下一站' }}</view>
   <label class="travel-field">城市 / 地点<select :disabled="busy" v-model="placeId" @change="onPlaceChange"><option v-for="p in places" :key="p.id" :value="p.id">{{ p.name }} · {{ p.regionName }}</option><option value="custom">自定义地点（填写坐标）</option></select></label>
   <view v-if="placeId==='custom'" class="custom-place"><label class="travel-field">地点名称<input :disabled="busy" v-model="customName" maxlength="60" aria-label="自定义地点名称"/></label><label class="travel-field">所属地区<select :disabled="busy" v-model="customRegion"><option v-for="r in regions" :key="r.id" :value="r.id">{{ r.name }}</option></select></label><view class="coordinate-row"><label class="travel-field">经度<input :disabled="busy" v-model="lng" type="digit" aria-label="地点经度"/></label><label class="travel-field">纬度<input :disabled="busy" v-model="lat" type="digit" aria-label="地点纬度"/></label></view><text class="travel-help">仅接收与本底图一致的原始坐标，未实现 GPS / GCJ-02 / BD-09 转换。预设地点来自同源边界中心数据；自定义坐标请自行核对，不能视为测绘精度定位。</text></view>
   <label class="travel-field">到访日期（选填）<input :disabled="busy" v-model="stopDate" maxlength="10" placeholder="YYYY-MM-DD" aria-label="到访日期"/></label>
   <label class="travel-field">关联手账照片<select :disabled="busy" v-model="photoSlot"><option value="">不关联照片</option><option v-if="editingPhotoId" value="keep">保留该记录已存照片</option><option v-for="n in 4" :key="n" :value="'p'+n">照片 {{ n }}{{ photoExamples['p'+n]?'（AI 示例，不可作真实足迹凭证）':'' }}</option></select></label><text class="travel-help">添加时保留该照片版本；以后替换或清空手账照片，不会改变已关联的旅行照片。未关联的槽位不会自动归档。</text>
   <label class="travel-field">这一站的小事<textarea :disabled="busy" v-model="stopNote" maxlength="500" aria-label="地点札记" placeholder="留下一个值得记住的片刻"/></label>
   <view class="travel-line"><button :disabled="busy" class="solid" @click="saveStop">{{ editingId?'保存地点修改':'添加地点' }}</button><button :disabled="busy" v-if="editingId" class="quiet" @click="cancelEdit">取消编辑</button><button :disabled="busy" class="quiet danger" @click="deleteTrip">删除本次旅行</button></view>
  </view>
  <view class="travel-divider"></view>
  <view class="travel-subtitle">本地草稿</view><text class="travel-help">{{ draftStatus }}。手动保存整个手账、旅行记录和照片；不跨设备同步。浏览器清理数据后不可恢复，重要成品请另存。当前保留 {{ retainedPhotoCount }} / 32 张手账或历史关联照片，编码总量上限 30 MB；不是已实测的手机容量承诺。</text>
  <view class="draft-actions"><button class="solid" :disabled="busy || (busy)" @click="$emit('save-draft')">保存本地草稿</button><button class="quiet" :disabled="busy || (busy)" @click="$emit('restore-draft')">恢复草稿</button><button class="quiet danger" :disabled="busy || (busy)" @click="$emit('clear-draft')">删除草稿</button></view>
  <text class="travel-warning">交互地图数据：阿里云 DataV GeoAtlas 公开 GeoJSON。数据许可、坐标体系和最终地图公开发布要求待进一步核验；原静态地图审图号不适用于本交互地图。当前仅作原型验证。</text>
  <view v-if="hint" class="travel-feedback" role="status">{{ hint }}</view>
 </view>
</template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import {computed,ref,watch,onMounted,onBeforeUnmount,nextTick} from 'vue'
import type {Journal,Stop,Place} from '../core/travel'
import {travelStats,uid,validDate,moveStop,visibleTrips} from '../core/travel'
import type {Palette} from '../types'
import placeData from '../data/places.json'
import {createTravelMap,regions} from '../platform/travel-map-h5'
const props=defineProps<{journal:Journal;palette:Palette;draftStatus:string;busy:boolean;photoThumbs:Record<string,string>;photoExamples:Record<string,boolean>;photoIds:Record<string,string>;retainedPhotoCount:number}>()
defineEmits(['save-draft','restore-draft','clear-draft','apply-trip'])
const j=props.journal,places=placeData as Place[],host=ref<any>(),regionsOpen=ref(false),hint=ref(''),mapError=ref(''),selectedStopId=ref('')
const editingPhotoId=ref(''),editingPhotoSlot=ref('')
const newTripName=ref(''),editingId=ref(''),placeId=ref(places[0].id),customName=ref(''),customRegion=ref('110000'),lng=ref('116.405285'),lat=ref('39.904989'),stopDate=ref(''),stopNote=ref(''),photoSlot=ref('')
const mapStops=computed(()=>visibleTrips(j).flatMap(t=>t.stops))
const stats=computed(()=>travelStats(j)),active=computed(()=>j.trips.find(t=>t.id===j.activeTrip)),selectedStop=computed(()=>j.trips.flatMap(t=>t.stops).find(s=>s.id===selectedStopId.value)),selectedThumb=computed(()=>selectedStop.value?props.photoThumbs[selectedStop.value.photoId||selectedStop.value.photoSlot]:'')
let map:ReturnType<typeof createTravelMap>|undefined,timer:ReturnType<typeof setTimeout>|undefined
function setSwitch(key:'mapEnabled'|'showRoutes',event:any){j[key]=!!event.detail.value}
function regionVisited(id:string){return j.visitedRegions.includes(id)||j.trips.some(t=>t.stops.some(s=>s.place.region===id))}
function toggleRegion(id:string){if(props.busy)return;const at=j.visitedRegions.indexOf(id);if(at>=0){j.visitedRegions.splice(at,1);hint.value=regionVisited(id)?'已移除手动标记；该地区仍有到访记录，因此继续高亮。':'已移除手动地区标记'}else{j.visitedRegions.push(id);hint.value='已标记该地区去过；可再次点击取消手动标记'}j.mapEnabled=true}
async function mountMap(){await nextTick();try{map?.dispose();const node=host.value?.$el||host.value;if(!node)throw new Error('地图容器未准备好');map=createTravelMap(node,toggleRegion,id=>{selectedStopId.value=id});map.update(j,props.palette);mapError.value=''}catch{mapError.value='互动地图加载失败；仍可编辑记录并使用静态手账导出。'}}
function resetView(){map?.reset()}
watch(()=>[j,props.palette],()=>{clearTimeout(timer);timer=setTimeout(()=>{try{map?.update(j,props.palette)}catch{mapError.value='地图更新失败，请重试'}},100)},{deep:true})
watch(()=>j.activeTrip,()=>cancelEdit())
function addTrip(){if(!newTripName.value.trim()){hint.value='请先填写旅行名称';return}if(j.trips.length>=100){hint.value='最多保存 100 次旅行';return}const t={id:uid(),name:newTripName.value.trim(),note:'',stops:[]};j.trips.push(t);j.activeTrip=t.id;j.mapEnabled=true;newTripName.value='';hint.value='旅行已创建，请添加第一站'}
function onPlaceChange(){/* Keep stop identity when editing a different city. */}
function saveStop(){if(!active.value)return;if(!validDate(stopDate.value)){hint.value='日期无效，请使用 YYYY-MM-DD，例如 2026-10-23';return}let place:Place
 if(placeId.value==='custom'){const region=regions.find(r=>r.id===customRegion.value),coord:[number,number]=[Number(lng.value),Number(lat.value)];if(!customName.value.trim()||!lng.value.trim()||!lat.value.trim()||!coord.every(Number.isFinite)||coord[0]<73||coord[0]>136||coord[1]<3||coord[1]>54||!region){hint.value='请填写地点名称、所属地区和有效经纬度（73–136，3–54）';return}place={id:`custom:${customRegion.value}:${customName.value.trim()}:${coord.join(',')}`,name:customName.value.trim(),region:region.id,regionName:region.name,coord}}else place=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(places.find(p=>p.id===placeId.value)!))
 if(photoSlot.value&&photoSlot.value!=='keep'&&!props.photoIds[photoSlot.value]){hint.value='该照片槽位为空，请先添加照片，或选择不关联照片。';return}
 if(props.photoExamples[photoSlot.value]){hint.value='关联的是 AI 示例照片，请先替换为自己的照片，或选择不关联照片。';return}
 if(!editingId.value&&stats.value.stops>=500){hint.value='最多保存 500 个到访记录';return}
 const stop:Stop={id:editingId.value||uid(),place,date:stopDate.value,note:stopNote.value,photoSlot:photoSlot.value==='keep'?editingPhotoSlot.value:photoSlot.value,photoId:photoSlot.value==='keep'?editingPhotoId.value:props.photoIds[photoSlot.value]||undefined};const index=active.value.stops.findIndex(s=>s.id===editingId.value);if(index>=0)active.value.stops[index]=stop;else active.value.stops.push(stop);j.mapEnabled=true;cancelEdit();hint.value='地点已保存；路线按列表顺序连接，可用上移、下移调整'}
function editStop(s:Stop){editingId.value=s.id;const preset=places.find(p=>p.id===s.place.id);placeId.value=preset?preset.id:'custom';customName.value=s.place.name;customRegion.value=s.place.region;lng.value=String(s.place.coord[0]);lat.value=String(s.place.coord[1]);stopDate.value=s.date;stopNote.value=s.note;editingPhotoId.value=s.photoId||'';editingPhotoSlot.value=s.photoSlot;photoSlot.value=s.photoId?'keep':s.photoSlot}
function cancelEdit(){editingId.value='';editingPhotoId.value='';editingPhotoSlot.value='';stopDate.value='';stopNote.value='';photoSlot.value=''}
async function ask(title:string){return new Promise<boolean>(resolve=>uni.showModal({title,content:'此操作不可撤销；已保存的本地草稿不会自动改变。',success:r=>resolve(r.confirm),fail:()=>resolve(false)}))}
async function removeStop(id:string){if(!active.value||!await ask('删除这个到访记录？'))return;active.value.stops=active.value.stops.filter(s=>s.id!==id);if(editingId.value===id)cancelEdit()}
async function deleteTrip(){if(!active.value||!await ask('删除整次旅行和所有到访记录？'))return;j.trips=j.trips.filter(t=>t.id!==j.activeTrip);j.activeTrip='all';cancelEdit()}
onMounted(mountMap);onBeforeUnmount(()=>{clearTimeout(timer);map?.dispose()})
</script>
<style scoped>
.travel-studio{margin-top:28px;background:#fffdf7;border:1px solid #e1e1d7;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;color:#39473d}.studio-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#687b65}.studio-title{font-size:28px;font-weight:650;margin-top:6px}.local-badge{font-size:12px;color:#61745c;background:#edf1e7;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:6px}.travel-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin:24px 0;background:#f2f3e9;border-radius:8px;padding:20px}.travel-stats>view{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.travel-stats text:first-child{font-size:32px;color:#3f5a45}.travel-stats text:last-child{font-size:14px;color:#69725e}.travel-map{height:480px;width:100%;background:#e6f0ed;border:1px solid #dbe4d8;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}.map-tools,.travel-line,.draft-actions,.stop-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}.map-tools .toggle-label{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;font-size:14px}.map-tools input{width:18px;height:18px}.quiet,.solid,.region-grid button,.trip-chip{min-height:44px;line-height:22px;font-size:14px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:6px}.quiet{background:#f2f3e9;color:#526c58}.solid{background:#3f5a45;color:#fff}.danger{color:#964a37}.quiet[disabled]{opacity:.4}.travel-help{display:block;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#6c735f}.travel-warning{display:block;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#86613f;background:#fff4e0;border:1px solid #e7d6b9;padding:12px;border-radius:6px;margin-top:16px}.travel-line select{flex:1;min-width:140px}.travel-field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:14px;color:#59644f;margin:14px 0}.travel-field input,.travel-field textarea,.travel-field select,.travel-line input,.travel-line select{font-size:16px;color:#39473d;background:#f8f7ef;border:1px solid #dfe2d4;border-radius:6px;width:100%;padding:10px 12px;min-height:44px;box-sizing:border-box}.travel-field textarea{min-height:84px;height:84px}.new-trip-label{flex:1;min-width:150px;font-size:13px;color:#69725e;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.travel-line input{flex:1;min-width:150px}.travel-line select{max-width:100%}.travel-divider{border-top:1px solid #e5e5d9;margin:24px 0}.travel-subtitle{font-size:21px;font-weight:600}.travel-subtitle.small{font-size:17px;margin-top:20px}.travel-empty{padding:24px;background:#f8f6ec;color:#71745e;line-height:1.7;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}.region-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:12px}.region-grid button{background:#f5f3e9;color:#59644f;font-size:12px;padding:8px}.region-grid button.visited{background:#e2ebda;border:1px solid #6b855f;color:#365233}.apply-trip{margin:16px 0 8px}.trip-list{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.trip-chip{background:#f2f3e9;color:#5d6b54}.trip-chip.current{background:#dfe9d7;border:1px solid #77946d}.coordinate-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.coordinate-row>label{min-width:0}.timeline{margin-top:24px}.timeline-stop{display:flex;gap:14px;border-left:1px solid #cdd6c2;padding:0 0 16px 16px;margin-left:14px}.stop-dot{background:#e4ebda;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;font-size:13px;line-height:28px;text-align:center;margin-left:-30px}.stop-content{flex:1;min-width:0}.stop-title{font-size:17px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.stop-title text{font-size:13px;color:#6a775e}.stop-note{display:block;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:14px;margin-top:6px}.stop-actions{justify-content:flex-start;gap:8px}.stop-actions .quiet{padding:8px 10px;font-size:13px}.travel-feedback{margin-top:16px;border:1px solid #bdcca9;background:#eff3e6;padding:12px;line-height:1.6;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px}.map-stop-list{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}.selected-stop{background:#f4f3e9;border:1px solid #d7dec9;border-radius:8px;padding:14px;margin-top:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.stop-photo{width:160px;height:110px}.draft-actions{justify-content:flex-start}.custom-place{padding:8px 14px;background:#f5f4eb;border-radius:8px}
@media(max-width:740px){.travel-studio{padding:20px;margin-top:20px}.studio-title{font-size:24px}.travel-map{height:370px}.travel-stats{padding:16px;gap:10px}.travel-stats text:first-child{font-size:28px}.travel-stats text:last-child{font-size:12px}.region-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.studio-heading{align-items:flex-start}.local-badge{font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap}.travel-line{gap:8px}.travel-line input{min-width:120px}.travel-help{font-size:13px}.draft-actions button{flex:1;min-width:120px}.coordinate-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.travel-map{touch-action:none}}
</style>
